{"url": "https://www.kampurcollege.ac.in/courseofstudy.php", "retrieved": "2026-10-02", "status": "ok", "final_url": "https://www.kampurcollege.ac.in/courseofstudy.php", "text": "Course of Study\nSSS\n|\nAnti Ragging\n|\nOld Website\n|\nOnline Portal\nFollow us on social media\nContact Us\n×\nCollege Location\nKampur, Nagaon, Assam\n03672 291866\n[email protected]\nAdmission Form of Pragya Academy\nVisitors Note\n×\nRenewal Admission\nUser Id\nPassword\nLogIn\nNew Enrolment ?\nAbout\nAbout College\nMission & Vision\nOrganogram\nPerspective Plan\nGoverning Body\nCells & Committees\nRules & Regulations\nPrincipal Handbook\nEmployee Handbook\nStudent Handbook\nFundamental Rights & Duties\nAcademics\nDepartments\nAdmission & Courses\nOnline Admission\nCourse of Study\nAdmission Procedure\nVocational Course\nCourse Outcome\nStaff\nTeaching Staff\nLibrary Staff\nNon-Teaching Staff\nIQAC\nAbout IQAC\nMinutes of IQAC\nAcademic Calenders\nPrograms & Activities\nMOU\nStudent Exchange Programmes\nFaculty Exchange Programmes\nExtension Activities\nInformation of Adopted Villages\nProcedures & Policies\nFeedback Report\nBest Practices\nInstitutional Distinctiveness\nAnnual Quality Assurance Report\nIIQA\nSSR\nSSR Reports\nNAAC 2nd Cycle SSR\nSupporting Documents\nDVV\nNIRF\nHandbooks\nPerspective Plan and Deployment Document\nINSTITUTIONAL DISTINCTIVENESS\nDVV - Extended Profile\nStudent Satisfaction Survey\nAudit\nAudit\nInstitutional Development Plan\nAAA\nPerformance report\nAnti Ragging Compliance\nActive Role as Member Secretary of the Governing B\nTimely Updation of Records of Employees and Operat\nTimely submission of Utilization Certificate\nInstitutional Social Responsibility\nSuccessful Completion of at Least One Course From\nVidyanjali\nNAAC\nNAAC Documents\nAll India Survey of Higher Education Certificate (\nNAAC Recommendation Compliance Report\nCompliance with NAAC guidelines\nAccreditation completed and NAAC Grade awarded\nNIRF\nFacilities\nKey Facilities\nStudents' Corner\nStudents' Aid Fund\nLibrary\nAttendance & Exam\nCareer Counseling & Guidance Cell\nLibrary\nGallery\nProspectus\nContact\nCourse of Study\nThe college offers courses of study in Arts faculty upto Degree Regular \r\n                and Major courses under Gauhati University.\nThree (3) years B.A. Course under Gauhati University.\nDistance Education under KKHSOU and Centre for Distance and Online Education, Gauhati University .\nVocational Courses in:\ni. Knitting and Embroidery.\nii. Cosmetology(Beautician and Make up)\niii. Computer Courses ( DCA Course, ADCA Course and Tally Course )\nDownload\nUG-CBCS GUIDELINE\nCOURSE OFFERS 20-21\n1. Three (3) years B.A. Course under Gauhati University.\nThe college provides three years Degree Course, both Major and General in Arts under Gauhati University. From the Session \r\n                    2019-20 ,Gauhati University introduces Choice Based Credit System for undergraduate degree programme. Under CBCS regulation, \r\n                    students who wish to take Honours subject, will have to complete the following papers in 6 semesters.\na.\t14 core papers in any one discipline (subject).\nb.\t2 ability enhancement compulsory courses.\nc.\t2 skill enhancement courses (minimum)\nd.\t4 discipline specific elective\ne.\t4 generic elective papers\nIn the 3rd year degree course under CBCS regulation, students without Honours subject, will have to complete the following \r\n                    papers in 6 semesters.\na.\t4 core papers each in two disciplines of choice.\nb.\t2 core papers each in English and MIL/Alt. English respectively.\nc.\t2 ability enhancement compulsory courses.\nd.\t4 skill enhancement compulsory courses\ne.\t2 papers each from a list of discipline specific elective papers based on the two disciplines of choice selected above.\nf.\t2 papers from the list of generic elective papers\n1.1 Honours Courses\nIn the first semester major courses students will have to take,\ni.\t2 papers in the honours subject\nii.\t1 paper in English/MIL communication\niii.\t1 paper in Environmental Science\niv.\t1 paper in Generic Elective course\n1.2 In the first semester Regular or General courses students will have to take:\ni.\tEnglish -1\nii.\t1 paper in English/MIL communication\niii.\t1 paper in Environmental Science\niv.\t1 paper in Elective -1\nv.\t1 paper in Elective-2\n2. Distance Education under KKHSOU and Centre for Distance and Online Education, Gauhati University :\nThe College has a recognized Study Centre of Krishna KantaHandiqui State Open University. Courses of study \r\n                    in KKHSOU are-\na.\tBPP Course: Bachelor of Preparatory Programme\nb.\tDiploma in Elementary Education Programme\nc.\tB.A. Course\n3. Self-sponsored Vocational Courses in:\ni.\tKnitting and Embroidery.\nii.\tCosmetology(Beautician and Make up)\nKampur, Nagaon\nAssam\nVisitor Counter\nImportant Links\n>\nGauhati University\n>\nTezpur University\n>\nNAAC\n>\nDibrugarh University\n>\nAssam University\n>\nUGC\n>\nSamarth\nQuick Links\n>\nPrincipal\n>\nGallery\n>\nMission & Vision\n>\nAdmission\n>\nContact\n>\nOnline Portal\nLocate Us\nCopyright © 2023 Kampur College | Powered By\nS.S.\r\n                Technologies", "links": [{"label": "SSS", "url": "https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1YCqnc1PTF2yXSAirCDBZHAGYV5AGleK0VStjASlZM6Y/viewform?ts=64687a40&edit_requested=true"}, {"label": "Anti Ragging", "url": "https://www.antiragging.in/affidavit_affiliated_form.php"}, {"label": "Old Website", "url": "http://kampurcollege.in/"}, {"label": "Online Portal", "url": "https://www.kampurcollege.ac.in/online/"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://youtube.com/@kampurcollegeofficial2386"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100078056179366"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://twitter.com/kampurcollege?s=20"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://www.kampurcollege.ac.in/index.php"}, {"label": "[email protected]", "url": "https://www.kampurcollege.ac.in/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection"}, 